{
  "case_id": "A-026",
  "category": "kbest_matching",
  "description": [
    "K-best bipartite matchings (Murty's algorithm): Initialize priority queue with optimal matching. ",
    "Iteratively extract minimum-cost matching, partition solution space by fixing matched edge prefix and forbidding subsequent edges, ",
    "and solve subproblems via shortest augmenting paths until K solutions found or queue exhausts. ",
    "Rectangular padding can yield duplicate original matchings after trimming."
